listing is super slow..

apps/console/web/src/utils/api.ts:510. Since we have multiple pages, the invocation is sequential.. this is why single request probably take 2-3s but entire page shows after 10s-20s

```
export async function listAllJobs(): Promise<Job[]> {
  const PAGE_LIMIT = 200;
  const MAX_PAGES = 50;
  let after: string | undefined;
  for (let page = 0; page < MAX_PAGES; page++) {
    const res = await listJobs({ after, limit: PAGE_LIMIT });  // ← 串行 await
    ...
    if (!res.hasMore || !last?.id) break;
    after = last.id;
  }
}
```

